# Keep only these top-level folders in the repository
*
!.gitignore
!BusSimulator/
!BusSimulator/**
!TursibBackend/
!TursibBackend/**
!TursibFrontend/
!TursibFrontend/**

# Sensitive files
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# .NET build output
**/bin/
**/obj/

# Frontend dependencies and build output
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/

# Common logs and OS files
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db